{"unit_id":"Rainier-Z__dsh-workspace-monitor#card-zh","repo":"Rainier-Z/dsh-workspace-monitor","commit":"07f778248112eb28116872cbb8c449529e84ff8b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-workspace-monitor 是供 DSH Desktop 使用的工作区文件变化监测插件。它在每个会话中注册命令和六个工具，创建可持久化的监测任务，并由后台调度器按间隔扫描工作区的文件元数据。任务可创建、列出、修改、暂停、恢复或删除；扫描会比较新增、修改和删除项，整理成摘要通知。它适合希望持续了解项目文件变化并在 DSH 会话中收到更新的用户。默认每 60 秒扫描一次，可调整间隔、忽略规则及扫描和摘要上限。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:11-25"]}
{"unit_id":"Rainier-Z__dsh-workspace-monitor#card-en","repo":"Rainier-Z/dsh-workspace-monitor","commit":"07f778248112eb28116872cbb8c449529e84ff8b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-workspace-monitor adds a command and six tools to DSH Desktop for session-owned workspace monitoring. A background scheduler compares file metadata and reports additions, edits, and deletions. Users can create, list, update, pause, resume, and delete tasks. Scans default to every 60 seconds.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:11-25"]}
